   "lines": [
    "Bade adieu to the Whitneys,",
    "and came on to New York.",
    "So ends my Junior",
    "Year; and I can not",
    "possibly conceive of",
    "any fellow having a",
    "pleasanter time than",
    "I have had. I doubt",
    "if I ever shall enjoy",
    "myself so much",
    "again. I have done",
    "well in my studies",
    "and I have had a",
    "most royally good",
    "time with the Club,",
    "my horse, and above",
    "all the sweet, pretty",
    "girls at Chestnut",
    "Hill &c."
   ],
